Kept: each district's number, name and outline, turned from UTM zone 33
(EPSG:25833) into longitude and latitude. This is a modified version of
the data.


The workflow's results
----------------------

The template carries each workflow step's result from its run on
2026-10-25 (results/<step id>.parquet): the squares' middles, each
middle's nearest supermarket and its distance, each middle's district,
and the people per district with those more than 1 km away, their share
and the average distance. They are made from all three sources together
and carry each one's terms: the results that hold OpenStreetMap's
supermarkets are derived databases under the ODbL, and the credits of
the two DL-DE-BY-2.0 sources go with them.


